

---- CSVPATH ----

~ name: baseline scan
  description: a deliberately header-agnostic statement -- works against any
    CSV/TSV/etc. regardless of column names, so it can be registered against
    whichever named-file the corpus generator points it at.
~

$[*][
    @lines.onmatch = count_lines()
    yes()
]

---- CSVPATH ----

~ name: generated check 2
  description: appended by the corpus generator to force a new
    version/load with a distinct content fingerprint.
~

$[*][
    yes()
]